					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tl333s" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1304786); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1304786&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608238167" alt="TL333s" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1304786)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tl333s" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1304786); return false;" >TL333s</a></span> <span class="odate time_1531168989 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">09 Jul 2018 20:43</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3868125">
									

<p>At first, I was rather annoyed by the way this was written, but I think it's actually far more clever than I gave it credit for. That said, it needs some cleanup still and the discovery addendum goes on rather a bit with large paragraphs, making for a bulky ending. There's also probably a little too much Series I-style redaction.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;One&nbsp;thing,&nbsp;though</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>I thought for a bit that the number 4 had significance. Just about everything the Foundation describes itself doing with this comes in fours: four sites a chamber is being constructed, four MTFs, just about everything comes in fours, and you've even got <em>Fore</em>sight heading up containment. But after the interview &#8212; in which Sidd demonstrates <em>five</em> personalities, if I'm not mistaken &#8212; that seems to go out the window, and I was disappointed by that. I don't know if it was intentional, but it's like you were building up to something and then forgot the payoff.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>That said, upvote after the contest.</p>

							</div>

								
					
